# The Barman Cloud plugin of CloudNativePG (the platform layer of R-HA-023: continuous WAL archiving and base backups to the bucket
# trove-pg-archive; installed by `TROVE_PITR=1 make dev-up`, deploy/dev/lib.sh barman_plugin_manifest, deploy/dev/pitr.yaml). It is one pin in
# three places: the release's manifest.yaml (a GitHub release asset, fetched with tools/github-download.sh and checked against the SHA-256
# below, the digest GitHub reports for the asset), the operator image the manifest runs and the sidecar image it injects into every
# PostgreSQL pod (the manifest holds the sidecar in a Secret by tag; up.sh replaces it by the digest below). Both images are the
# multi-arch indexes. A new version is one edit of all four lines; up.sh refuses a pin whose image tags differ from the version. Version 0.15
# needs CloudNativePG 1.30 or later (DEV_CNPG_OPERATOR_IMAGE).
DEV_BARMAN_PLUGIN_VERSION=v0.15.1
